WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Jerusalem, at a festival,
50 days after Passover.

2
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:09.370
The Book of Acts tells how Jesus'
apostles are together in one house.

3
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:13.670
Suddenly, a sound like a
rushing, mighty wind fills it.

4
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:18.120
Then tongues like fire appear,
and one rests on each of them.

5
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:22.410
Crowds from many nations gather, and
each person hears them speaking in their

6
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.060
own language.

7
00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:28.920
What really happened at Pentecost, and
why does it still matter to Christians?

8
00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:31.360
In this mission, you'll read that account,

9
00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.010
one step at a time.

10
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:37.360
Then you'll see why churches today
worship in such different ways.

11
00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:40.630
Your mission: find out
what happened at Pentecost,

12
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:41.950
and why it matters.
